#. module: layout_din5008
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_base_document_layout__layout_din5008_logo_position
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_res_company__layout_din5008_logo_position
msgid ""
"Horizontal position of the company logo in the letterhead. The tagline is "
"printed on the opposite side."
msgstr ""
"Horizontale Position des Unternehmenslogos im Briefkopf. Der Slogan wird auf "
"der gegenüberliegenden Seite gedruckt."

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:layout_din5008.selection__res_company__layout_din5008_logo_position__left
msgid "Left"
msgstr "Links"

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:layout_din5008.view_base_document_layout
msgid "Logo Position"
msgstr "Logoposition"

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_base_document_layout__layout_din5008_address_height
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_res_company__layout_din5008_address_height
msgid ""
"Minimum height of the address window row. The document title starts below "
"this row."
msgstr ""
"Mindesthöhe der Zeile mit dem Anschriftfeld. Der Dokumenttitel beginnt "
"unterhalb dieser Zeile."

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_base_document_layout__layout_din5008_fold_marks
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_res_company__layout_din5008_fold_marks
msgid "Print fold marks and the hole mark on the left edge of every page."
msgstr "Falzmarken und Lochmarke am linken Rand jeder Seite drucken."

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_base_document_layout__layout_din5008_sender_line
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_res_company__layout_din5008_sender_line
msgid ""
"Print the company address as a single line above the recipient address "
"(Rücksendeangabe), visible in the envelope window."
msgstr ""
"Die Unternehmensadresse einzeilig über der Empfängeranschrift drucken "
"(Rücksendeangabe), sichtbar im Fenster des Briefumschlags."

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_base_document_layout__layout_din5008_remark_zone_height
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_res_company__layout_din5008_remark_zone_height
msgid ""
"Height of the remark zone (Zusatz- und Vermerkzone) between the sender line "
"and the recipient address. DIN 5008 reserves 12.7 mm; 0 places the recipient "
"address directly below the sender line."
msgstr ""
"Höhe der Zusatz- und Vermerkzone zwischen Rücksendeangabe und "
"Empfängeranschrift. DIN 5008 sieht 12,7 mm vor; 0 setzt die "
"Empfängeranschrift direkt unter die Rücksendeangabe."

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:layout_din5008.selection__res_company__layout_din5008_logo_position__right
msgid "Right"
msgstr "Rechts"

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model:ir.model,name:layout_din5008.model_ir_actions_report
msgid "Report Action"
msgstr "Berichtsaktion"

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:layout_din5008.view_base_document_layout
msgid "Sender Line"
msgstr "Rücksendeangabe"

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_base_document_layout__layout_din5008_address_offset_top
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_res_company__layout_din5008_address_offset_top
msgid ""
"Vertical shift of the address window relative to the DIN 5008 position "
"directly below the letterhead. Negative values move it up."
msgstr ""
"Vertikale Verschiebung des Anschriftfelds gegenüber der DIN-5008-Position "
"direkt unter dem Briefkopf. Negative Werte verschieben es nach oben."

#. module: layout_din5008
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_base_document_layout__layout_din5008_informations_position
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:layout_din5008.field_res_company__layout_din5008_informations_position
msgid ""
"Where the document information (dates, references, ...) of the standard "
"reports is printed. 'Beside the address' moves the block next to the address"
" window after rendering."
msgstr ""
"Wo die Dokumentinformationen (Daten, Referenzen, ...) der Standardberichte "
"gedruckt werden. „Neben der Anschrift“ verschiebt den Block nach dem "
"Rendern neben das Anschriftfeld."
